{"id":"f900d02215c06646","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-multitape-dtm-language-simulation.md","title":"Single-Tape and Multitape Equivalence","display":"thm-multitape-turing-equivalence — Single-Tape and Multitape Equivalence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-multitape-dtm-language-simulation","aliases":["73-thm-multitape-dtm-language-simulation","73-thm-multitape-turing-equivalence"],"display":"thm-multitape-turing-equivalence — Single-Tape and Multitape Equivalence","depends_on":["[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.4, print pp. 343–352; PDF pp. 365–374; normalized model translation","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§7.5, pp. 159–166; local normalized tape-model interfaces","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-multitape-dtm-language-simulation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-multitape-dtm-language-simulation</span><span>73-thm-multitape-turing-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-multitape-turing-equivalence — Single-Tape and Multitape Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9fa7db79fea5f29a\" href=\"?note=9fa7db79fea5f29a\" title=\"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics\">73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.4, print pp. 343–352; PDF pp. 365–374; normalized model translation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§7.5, pp. 159–166; local normalized tape-model interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 的输入字母表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (single-tape and multitape deterministic machines)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\cdot)\">\\(L(\\cdot)\\)</span> (the corresponding accepted-language maps)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left[\n\\exists M\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(T)\\}\\;(L=L(M))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(S))\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left[\n\\exists M\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(T)\\}\\;(L=L(M))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(S))\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A single-tape machine is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=1\">\\(k=1\\)</span> case. Conversely, one tape stores all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> tapes in delimited tracks and sweeps across them to simulate one multitape step.</li>\n<li>Breadth and delimiters are finite for each simulated configuration, so the simulation preserves acceptance, rejection, and divergence; its standard time overhead is at most quadratic.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"9fa7db79fea5f29a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-multitape-dtm-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"L(\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}multitape\\text{-}turing\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left[\n\\exists M\\in\\{T:\\operatorname{MDTM}_{\\Sigma}(T)\\}\\;(L=L(M))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L(S))\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"k=1","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1966,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-multitape-dtm-language-simulation|Single-Tape and Multitape Equivalence]]"},{"id":"31034767f7505eb4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["9fa7db79fea5f29a","888d8ab66ec7efca"]}